// Example:
//
//   int x = 3, y = 5;
//   CHECK_EQ(2 * x, y) << "oops!";
//
// Might produce a message like:
//
//   Check failed: 2 * x == y (6 vs. 5) oops!
//
// The values must implement the appropriate comparison operator as well as
// `operator<<(std::ostream&, ...)`.  Care is taken to ensure that each
